      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a similar Canny report.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/contact-receivers-fail-to-trigger-onenter-if-starting-in-an-overlapped-state-wit\n\nIt seems that this issue had already been recognized for some time, and VRCFury appears to address it in the following way.\n\nFor 10 frames after the avatar is loaded or after avatar scaling, Contact Receivers are set to Inactive.\n\nhttps://github.com/VRCFury/VRCFury/blob/dba5ec3b0f7f7c8742a4c416d75a1002adcf7275/com.vrcfury.vrcfury/Editor-Avatars/Service/OverlappingContactsFixService.cs#L31\n\nThis issue occurs relatively frequently and is causing significant problems when creating gimmicks.\n\nI hope this can eventually be addressed on the VRChat side.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
